go 1.26.0

toolchain go1.26.7

// Deliberately a single-module workspace, mirroring gzh-cli-quality (605ea39).
// It is tracked to stop `go` from walking up into a parent workspace and to keep
// this repository buildable outside the devbox layout. Cross-repository devbox
// tests explicitly select the generated root workspace through GOWORK instead.
use .

// The go directive carries the patch component on purpose. go.mod requires
// go 1.26.0, and `go` reads a bare `1.26` as ordering before 1.26.0, so the
// workspace refuses the module it is built to contain.
